# Videos live in GitHub Releases (index: RENDERS.md), never in git history.
# Each renders/<id>/ keeps only its small post kit in git: post.md, captions.srt, manifest.json, cover.jpg
*.mp4
*.wav
*.mov
*.m4a
renders/**/contact.jpg
renders/**/composition.html
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# per-video capture packs live in the workspace (and in Releases with their video), not in git
captures/
# other creators' full transcripts: workspace-only research (public repo gets metrics + short excerpts only)
research/social/raw/
